  "long_description": "Housewarming is social media and AI designed to bring you closer to your friends, not replace them or keep you isolated in an algorithm.\r\n\r\nWe've been building mega-viral consumer AI experiences since 2020. From the music discovery app Discz (1.5M users) to creative expression with Verse & Internet Bedroom (0-10 million users in 30 days, one of the fastest growing products of all-time) we like building at the frontier of technology in ways consumer truly love.\r\n\r\nHousewarming is our latest and most delightful product ever. Check it out, share moments with your friends, and let us know what you think :)",
